# L §4.2 Date arithmetic: "a period plus any other duration (`m + 10 days`) is refused (§8.4)": the types show it,
# LOAD-UNIT at load (the figure is a row, L §7.1).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input ten: num day

def c[m in months]: month = m + ten

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  ten = 10 day

ask q: c[2026-03]
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
